### Login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin123" }

### Protected: with token
@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Protected: no token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/ping

### Protected: tampered token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}x

### Public
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/.well-known/jwks.json

### Create user (as admin)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "user2", "password": "Parola123", "role": "ROLE_USER", "orgUnit": "SCHOOL_1" }
